    "excerpt": "The acid-resistant cable ties GT PP are made of high-quality polypropylene. They convince with very good resistance to most acids, bases and greases and low water absorption.",
    "body": "The acid-resistant cable ties GT PP are made of high-quality polypropylene.\n\nThey convince with very good resistance to most acids, bases and greases and low water absorption.\n\nThe operating temperature of the PP cable ties is -35 °C to +85 °C.\n\n## Application:\n\nEspecially in critical applications with the risk of acid contact, the use of acid-resistant PP cable ties is recommended.\n\nWould you like advice or a quote? Then get in touch – we will be happy to help!\n\nGT PP"
